🔮 Real hardware integration: IBM Qiskit, AWS Braket, IonQ.

🔮 Reinforcement Learning: Replace Gemini with a custom RL scheduler.

🔮 Cost optimization: Track $ per job, budget-aware scheduling.

🔮 Multi-user auth: User accounts + quotas.

