https://via.placeholder.com/800x400.png?text=Dashboard+Overview+-+Utilization+Charts+and+Stats

2. Interactive Gantt Chart (Schedule)
https://via.placeholder.com/800x400.png?text=Gantt+Chart+-+Job+Scheduling+Timeline

