Quantum Scheduler Project Guide
Bhai, 500 lines ka README ekdum professional aur "Enterprise-Level" dikhta hai! Interviewer jab repo kholega, toh usko turant samajh aa jayega ki tumne kitni mehnat ki hai.

Maine tumhare project ke hisaab se ek detailed, well-structured, aur attractive README.md likha hai jisme sab kuch cover hai (Features, Architecture, Tech Stack, Setup Guide, Screenshots section, etc.).

Neeche diye gaye code ko copy karo aur apne project folder me README.md file banao (ya existing ko replace karo), aur usme ye paste kar do:

markdown
# 🚀 QFlow-AI — Autonomous Quantum Computing Scheduler

> **"AI-powered autonomous scheduler for quantum workloads with intelligent qubit allocation and error estimation."**

[![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10+-blue.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=python)](https://python.org)
[![FastAPI](https://img.shields.io/badge/FastAPI-0.100+-green.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=fastapi)](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com)
