giginore file
Bhai, Git me .gitignore file bohot zaroori hoti hai. Ye file Git ko batati hai ki kaunsi files aur folders ko GitHub par upload NAHI karna hai.

Jaise ki tumhari venv (virtual environment) folder, jisme hazaron files hoti hain jo tumhare laptop se linked hoti hain, ya .env file jisme tumhari Gemini API Key hoti hai. Agar ye upload ho gayi, toh tumhari API key public ho jayegi aur koi bhi use kar sakta hai!

Neeche maine tumhare Python (FastAPI) + React (Vite) project ke liye ek best aur secure .gitignore file di hai.

🛠️ Kaise banaye?
Apne project ke main folder (C:\Users\HP\ai-quantum-scheduler) me ek nayi file banao jiska naam exactly .gitignore ho. (Dhyan rahe, shuru me dot . zaroori hai). Usme ye poora code copy-paste kar do:

